{"3398570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunny Battle Nemesis", "steam_appid": 3398570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/01_banner_colored.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bunny Battle Nemesis</i> is a fast-paced, combat-focused action-adventure experience. Play through the story campaign, either solo or co-op, where you will defend the otherwise peaceful Leporidae Kingdom from impending doom, as a ruthless force of mercenaries from the future invades and plunders the lands for their precious Dolomite stones. Gather Blood Drips from fallen enemies and use them to unlock new moves, and tailor your character to your preferred playstyle, in order to defeat the invading soldiers and their fearless leader Amanda!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/02_combat.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many of the classic games of the beat 'em up genre, <i>Bunny Battle Nemesis</i> presents a classic 2D perspective, but you are not stuck to a single plane: you can move in and out of the background, dodging attacks, positioning for advantage, and engaging enemies from all angles. Use this extra depth to outmaneuver foes, explore tactical opportunities, and unleash powerful combos in fast-paced battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/beat-em-up-ezgif.com_optimized.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/03_play-your-way.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of one of 4 characters, each with their own unique moveset and playstyle. Every character can unlock several different moves as the game progresses, and you can select whatever combination of moves you like best before each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/play-your-way_optimized.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/04_environment.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the beautiful, hand-crafted environments, that blend both 3D and 2D assets together to build a unique and captivating world known as the Leporidae Kingdom, where the Leporidae people live and prosper through the mining of Dolomites - magically charged stones of great power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/environment-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/01_banner_colored.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bunny Battle Nemesis</i> is a fast-paced, combat-focused action-adventure experience. Play through the story campaign, either solo or co-op, where you will defend the otherwise peaceful Leporidae Kingdom from impending doom, as a ruthless force of mercenaries from the future invades and plunders the lands for their precious Dolomite stones. Gather Blood Drips from fallen enemies and use them to unlock new moves, and tailor your character to your preferred playstyle, in order to defeat the invading soldiers and their fearless leader Amanda!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/02_combat.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many of the classic games of the beat 'em up genre, <i>Bunny Battle Nemesis</i> presents a classic 2D perspective, but you are not stuck to a single plane: you can move in and out of the background, dodging attacks, positioning for advantage, and engaging enemies from all angles. Use this extra depth to outmaneuver foes, explore tactical opportunities, and unleash powerful combos in fast-paced battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/beat-em-up-ezgif.com_optimized.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/03_play-your-way.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of one of 4 characters, each with their own unique moveset and playstyle. Every character can unlock several different moves as the game progresses, and you can select whatever combination of moves you like best before each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/play-your-way_optimized.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/line-break.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/04_environment.png?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the beautiful, hand-crafted environments, that blend both 3D and 2D assets together to build a unique and captivating world known as the Leporidae Kingdom, where the Leporidae people live and prosper through the mining of Dolomites - magically charged stones of great power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/extras/environment-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1755866633\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Enjoy a fast-paced modernized beat 'em up/hack and slash combat, either solo or co-op, with Bunny Battle Nemesis! Fight through legions of futuristic mercenaries, robots and their fearless leader Amanda, to defend the Leporidae Kingdom from certain doom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/01d1b65e8c91b9d9fb9e246019efecac18f79e54/header.jpg?t=1755866633", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/a6c23e8b777fccd1eaa72a422ca60a75ee5b3a53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755866633", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398570/a6c23e8b777fccd1eaa72a422ca60a75ee5b3a53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755866633", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo 2GHz+ or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTS 250 | AMD Radeon HD 6670<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DCF Studios"], "publishers": ["DCF Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 39, "description": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"},